113
00:08:10,180 --> 00:08:15,339
A local transaction cannot atomically
include an arbitrary remote API.

114
00:08:16,401 --> 00:08:23,029
Recovery needs cooperation at a
boundary, such as provider idempotency,

115
00:08:23,767 --> 00:08:28,641
lookup by operation reference, or a
documented reconciliation procedure.

116
00:08:29,909 --> 00:08:34,537
The diagram shows the additional
integration boundary we need to test.

117
00:08:36,182 --> 00:08:38,776
Consider the recovery
