118
00:08:39,688 --> 00:08:45,642
It says dispatch began and contains
the original key, but has no receipt.

119
00:08:46,373 --> 00:08:48,937
The record supports investigation.

120
00:08:49,768 --> 00:08:55,719
It cannot by itself establish either
