121
00:08:56,719 --> 00:09:00,346
This matrix is the practical
extension of the reproduction.

122
00:09:01,336 --> 00:09:04,793
Each row changes the fault
location, and therefore changes the

123
00:09:04,793 --> 00:09:06,705
