124
00:09:07,710 --> 00:09:12,079
Before dispatch, be careful
about claiming non-execution.

125
00:09:13,056 --> 00:09:18,202
An old worker may still send
unless you have fenced it out.

126
00:09:18,923 --> 00:09:25,617
After reservation, exactly one owner
