132
00:09:48,083 --> 00:09:51,499
The write assertion is not
always a successful retry.

133
00:09:52,084 --> 00:09:57,811
Sometimes the correct result is a
bounded unresolved state with an

134
00:09:57,841 --> 00:09:59,952
owner and a reconciliation route.

135
00:10:01,832 --> 00:10:08,252
A useful harness records that barrier
it reached before injecting the fault.

136
00:10:09,074 --> 00:10:14,352
For the remote commit row, first establish
