153
00:11:28,043 --> 00:11:31,757
Set a recovery expectation
alongside the safety assertion.

154
00:11:31,870 --> 00:11:39,615
For example, unresolved work must enter an
investigation queue with its own- with its

155
00:11:39,657 --> 00:11:42,567
original key and a scheduled follow-up.

156
00:11:43,781 --> 00:11:49,204
Otherwise, a test can pass its duplicate
